; Stage 2 / Discovery 01: normaligo dil 1-bazita modulo M.
; Independanta production-proceduro; la normativa oracle restas test-only.
; Ne rekonstruo dil perdita arkivo de 2026-08-29.

to monster.stage02.normalize :value
  localmake "division bi.divmod.floor :value nr.M
  localmake "remainder last :division
  if bi.eq :remainder bi.zero [output nr.M]
  output :remainder
end
